"Employment status of the civilian noninstitutional population, 1955 to date (https://www.bls.gov/cps/cpsaat01.pdf)\nciteturn64view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; Content type: application/pdf; Number of pages: 2; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.bls.gov/cps/cpsaat01.pdf\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 137\nL0@P0: HOUSEHOLD DATA\nL1@P0: ANNUAL AVERAGES\nL2@P0: 1. Employment status of the civilian noninstitutional population, 1955 to date\nL3@P0: [Numbers in thousands]\nL4@P0: Year\nL5@P0: Civilian\nL6@P0: noninstitu\u0002tional\nL7@P0: population\nL8@P0: Civilian labor force\nL9@P0: Not\nL10@P0: in\nL11@P0: labor\nL12@P0: force\nL13@P0: Total\nL14@P0: Percent\nL15@P0: of\nL16@P0: population\nL17@P0: Employed Unemployed\nL18@P0: Total\nL19@P0: Percent\nL20@P0: of\nL21@P0: population\nL22@P0: Agri\u0002culture\nL23@P0: Nonagri\u0002cultural\nL24@P0: industries\nL25@P0: Number\nL26@P0: Percent\nL27@P0: of\nL28@P0: labor\nL29@P0: force\nL30@P0: People 16 years of age and over\nL31@P0: 1955. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 109,683 65,023 59.3 62,170 56.7 6,450 55,722 2,852 4.4 44,660\nL32@P0: 1956. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 110,954 66,552 60.0 63,799 57.5 6,283 57,514 2,750 4.1 44,402\nL33@P0: 1957. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 112,265 66,929 59.6 64,071 57.1 5,947 58,123 2,859 4.3 45,336\nL34@P0: 1958. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 113,727 67,639 59.5 63,036 55.4 5,586 57,450 4,602 6.8 46,088\nL35@P0: 1959. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 115,329 68,369 59.3 64,630 56.0 5,565 59,065 3,740 5.5 46,960\nL36@P0: 1960. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 117,245 69,628 59.4 65,778 56.1 5,458 60,318 3,852 5.5 47